    {
      "number": 16,
      "pali": "Katame cha? ",
      "english": "What six? "
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "pali": "Kammārāmataṁ, bhassārāmataṁ, niddārāmataṁ, saṅgaṇikārāmataṁ, indriyesu aguttadvārataṁ, bhojane amattaññutaṁ. ",
      "english": "Relishing work, talk, sleep, and company, not guarding the sense doors, and eating too much. "
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "pali": "Ime kho, bhikkhave, cha dhamme pahāya bhabbo ajjhattabahiddhā dhammesu dhammānupassī viharitun”ti. ",
      "english": "After giving up these six qualities you can meditate observing an aspect of principles internally and externally.” "
